// External DRF -- the racy counterpart.
//
// rmm-zoo property: edrf (Reasoning guarantees / External DRF).
// Source: as MP+rel+acq-drf.lit in this directory.
//
// The same program with all-relaxed accesses. Under SC the two threads race on
// the data location, so external DRF says nothing and the model is free to admit
// the non-SC outcome -- and does. The pair is what makes the guarantee testable:
// a model that forbade this too would be stronger than external DRF requires,
// and one that allowed the release-acquire version would not have the guarantee
// at all.
data := 0;
f := 0;
{
  data :rlx= 1;
  f :rlx= 1
} ||| {
  r1 :rlx= f;
  r2 :rlx= data
}
%%
allow (r1 = 1 && r2 = 0) [C11]
